usage: raco mcp [ <option> ... ] [<args>] ...

<option> is one of

  --transport <value>
     stdio or http
  --state <value>
     SQLite state file
  --port <value>
     HTTP port
  --build-id <value>
     Declared application/runtime identity for ordinary loading
  --runtime-build-id <value>
     Immutable SDK/runtime build identity for captured loading
  --help, -h
     Show this help
  --
     Do not treat any remaining argument as a switch (at this level)

 Multiple single-letter switches can be combined after
 one `-`. For example, `-h-` is the same as `-h --`.
